OL,3,GNEWSA'I was paralysed - now I'm running
OL,4,A5,000km'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEsmee Gummer dreamed of becoming a
OL,7,Fprofessional dancer. At 18, and just
OL,8,Fsix weeks before she was due to start
OL,9,Fdance college, complications following
OL,10,Fsurgery left her paralysed from the
OL,11,Fwaist down and unsure if she would ever
OL,12,Fwalk again.
OL,14,FNow 35, she has swapped life at her
OL,15,Fhome in Hackney, east London, for a
OL,16,Fcampervan as she attempts to run
OL,17,F5,000km (3,107 miles) around the UK and
OL,18,FIreland.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
